t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">River Shop</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">50 Credits</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.51.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 1st, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<blockquote><p><i><big>\"Recovered from a nearby lab. When enabled, allows the user to see easier in the dark.\"</big></i></p></blockquote><p>The <b>Night Vision Goggles</b> (<b>NVG</b>), or <b>NV Goggles</b>, are an item that can be purchased from the <a href=\"/wiki/River_Shop\" title=\"River Shop\">River Shop</a> for 50 Lumite Credits. The item can be equipped by a player and worn on their head. The Night Vision Goggles help players to see in low-light environments, making them a useful item for cave exploration and mining.\n</p><p>Along with the <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_Scooba_Tank\" title=\"Refined Scooba Tank\">Refined Scooba Tank</a>, the NVG adds another hotbar above the main one, where the item will be displayed. In the hotbar, the NVG can be enabled and disabled with the \"on\" and \"off\" buttons. This extra hotbar can also be hidden by clicking the eye icon to the right of the main hotbar.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903004017\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.035 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 50/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 72/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019500/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.125      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   30.125      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2277-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903004017 and revision id 18592. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Refined Scooba Tank","exists":true},{"title":"River Shop","exists":true}],"images":["Night_Vision_Goggles_object.png","Night_Vision_Goggles.png"]}
